// NOTE: ECRA Router & QNMF/Transformer Verifier training/inference are implemented in C
// (internal/runtime/qadav_nn.c). This .ydv defines the network spec & stub.
//
// QNMF Pillar 6: ECRA Adaptive Compute Router + Learned Verifiers
// Router:    129 inputs (128-dim query embedding x_t + 1-dim uncertainty u_t) -> 64 ReLU -> 4 logits
// Verifiers: 16-dim post-execution verification probes -> 32 hidden -> 1 calibrated valid probability
//            Supports both QNMF Gated Verifier and Transformer LayerNorm Verifier

network EcraRouterNet ⟦
    dense ⟬129⸴ 64⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬64⸴ 4⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "ECRA_ROUTER_SPEC_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
